<title>USA: USDA to release export sales report on Friday.</title>
<headline>USDA to release export sales report on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said it will release its weekly export sales report on Friday, January 24, at O830 EST/1330 GMT, a one-day delay because of Monday's Martin Luther King holiday.</p>
<p>USDA normally issues the report on U.S. export sales of grains, oilseeds and products on Thursdays at 0830 EST.</p>
